lantern-pr 1
# 49
#title fix: keep a declined pull request visible as declined on both hosts
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/49
#branch fix/pr-declined-state
#base main
#opened 2026-11-13
#head 51c1d6cd09f5c8ce36ce45f1f8634a33a349edc4
#describe what A pull request closed without a merge, declined on Bitbucket or closed unmerged on GitHub, now stays in Lantern as declined on both hosts.
#describe before Once its branch was deleted and pruned, the declined pull request vanished, and the strip hid it two days after it was opened.
#describe after It stays as declined (host answered) or closed (host could not be asked) and shows for two days from when it was declined.
#describe verified typecheck, the full vitest run and the pull request host e2e are green; the new per-host tests fail on main.
+ src/main/lantern-pr-remembered.ts
~ CHANGELOG.md
~ src/main/lantern-host-drivers.ts
~ src/main/lantern-host-status.ts
~ src/main/lantern-prs.ts
~ src/main/lantern-types.ts
~ src/renderer/lib/lanternprs.ts
~ src/renderer/pr-info/index.ts
~ test/lantern-host-github.test.ts
~ test/lantern-host-status.test.ts
~ test/lantern-pr-declined.test.ts
~ test/lantern-prs.test.ts
#order src/main/lantern-types.ts
#order src/main/lantern-pr-remembered.ts
#order src/main/lantern-prs.ts
#order src/main/lantern-host-drivers.ts
#order src/main/lantern-host-status.ts
