#order CHANGELOG.md
#reason src/main/lantern-pr-remembered.ts A declined PR's record lives only on a branch that gets pruned, so it is remembered to keep the PR from vanishing.
#reason CHANGELOG.md Tells users a declined pull request no longer vanishes when its branch is deleted.
#reason src/main/lantern-host-drivers.ts Makes Bitbucket confirm closed pull requests with the host, as GitHub already did, so they read declined or merged.
#reason src/main/lantern-host-status.ts Keeps the time a pull request was noticed gone only while it stays declined, and drops it if the host reopens it.
#reason src/main/lantern-prs.ts Restores remembered records whose branch vanished, as closed with the time they were noticed gone.
#reason src/main/lantern-types.ts Adds closedAt so the strip can count a decline from when it happened.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternprs.ts Counts the two days a declined PR stays in the strip from its decline, not from when it was opened.
#reason src/renderer/pr-info/index.ts Reads declined in the hover card for a closed PR, matching the strip.
#reason test/lantern-host-github.test.ts Proves a closed-unmerged GitHub PR whose branch is deleted stays, declined or closed.
#reason test/lantern-host-status.test.ts Proves the Bitbucket equivalents and that the host is now asked about closed pull requests.
#reason test/lantern-pr-declined.test.ts Proves the strip timing from the decline and the declined word in the hover card.
#reason test/lantern-prs.test.ts Updates the test that expected a deleted branch to drop its PR, which now stays as closed.
#story A declined pull request stays visible
#step actor A reviewer
#file src/main/lantern-pr-remembered.ts
#file src/main/lantern-prs.ts
#step action declines a pull request and deletes its branch
#step subject the pull request in Lantern
#file src/main/lantern-host-drivers.ts
#below actor Anyone using Lantern
#below interaction still sees it, labelled declined
#file src/renderer/lib/lanternprs.ts
#file src/renderer/pr-info/index.ts
#file test/lantern-host-status.test.ts
#file test/lantern-host-github.test.ts
#below consequence it vanished with its branch => it stays as declined for two days
